    <string name="privacy_text">• This app does not ask for an account, email or phone number.\n• Your name, photo, quiz results, learning progress and (if enabled) chat history are stored only on your phone and are excluded from cloud backup.\n• When you send a question to the AI assistant, the question (and recent conversation) is sent over HTTPS to the backend you configured, which forwards it to an AI provider. If no backend URL is set, nothing leaves your phone.\n• AI API keys are never stored in the app; they live only on the backend.\n• The floating button works only if you grant permission and turn it on; you can turn it off at any time.\n• You can delete all local data from Settings.</string>
    <string name="about_text">Nusuk AI is an independent educational companion for learning Hajj and Umrah.\n\nIt is not the official Saudi Nusuk app and is not affiliated with any government body. It does not issue fatwas. The content is for learning only; for specific rulings follow a qualified scholar and the official guidance of the Hajj and Umrah authorities.\n\nVersion %1$s</string>
    <string name="float_explain_title">Floating button permission</string>
    <string name="float_explain_body">The floating AI button shows a small round button over other apps; tapping it opens the Nusuk AI assistant. This needs Android\'s \"Display over other apps\" permission. We do not read or record your screen. Grant the permission on the next screen, then come back. You can turn it off at any time in these settings.</string>
